      "writtenOn": "2021-09-15T15:20:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that the amount of unsafe code is fairly small, regardless of the complexity of the impl - converting to \u0026 from a void*, plus the call into \u0026 callback from C.",
      "parentUuid": "7012b358_dcd59343",
      "range": {
